msgstr ""
"Ezután kattintson a :guilabel:`Cloud Phone System` elemre a vezérlőpult "
"oldalsávjában. Ezután kattintson a :guilabel:`Launch admin UI` gombra."

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/voip/didww.rst:39
msgid ""
"The *phone.systems PBX* feature is an extra paid service in DIDWW, and may "
